Z||000022||Oreif||10-09-2000||01:28 AM||||I have sprint manifolds on my car. I bought them when they first came out from the Fiero Store. (back in 96/97) This was long before I knew of all the other options with manifolds and headers. But they work great! I especially like the fact they won't crack. I have heard that porting the stock manifolds provides the same gain as the sprints, (haven't seen any real data)<BR> but over time the stock ones could crack again. I also like the fact that the sprints use the exsisting exhaust system instead of custom made pieces which would add to the cost. This is just my opinion.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg"> ||||reg||1
